weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p016:m0002","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"note":"姓楊為完整同固定見證兩單元及逐步原生近系的編輯讀法；不依ID/label/族望，原名、字、本名與引文不改。","surname_basis":{"kind":"contextual_surname_from_bound_received_family_units","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"rationale":"原全文名seed及每步已錄具名兄弟、父子或明父祖原詞同一固定魏058見證；非組裝父邊推姓。","source_name_record_id":"name-weishu058-yangchun-exact","source_full_quote":"北都時，朝法嚴急。太和初，吾兄弟三人並居內職，兄在高祖左右，吾與津在文明太后左右。于時口敕，責諸內官，十日仰密得一事，不列便大瞋嫌。諸人多有依敕密列者，亦有太后、高祖中間傳言構間者。吾兄弟自相誡曰：「今忝二聖近臣，母子間甚難，宜深慎之。又列人事，亦何容易，縱被瞋責，慎勿輕言。」十餘年中，不嘗言一人罪過，當時大被嫌責。答曰：「臣等非不聞人言，正恐不審，仰誤聖聽，是以不敢言。」於後終以不言蒙賞。及二聖間言語，終不敢輒爾傳通。太和二十一年，吾從濟州來朝，在清徽堂豫讌。高祖謂諸王、諸貴曰：「北京之日，太后嚴明，吾每得杖，左右因此有是非言語。和朕母子者唯楊椿兄弟。」遂舉賜四兄及我酒。汝等脫若萬一蒙時主知遇，宜深慎言語，不可輕論人惡也。","source_units":[{"chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun","native_path":"corpus/weishu-weishou/058-yangchun.json","work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun-ws2087998","source_revision":2087998,"raw_path":"source-evidence/weishu058-yangchun/primary/weishu058.wikitext","raw_file_sha256":"a53ae2dbced88decaa460fbf34f87bb5e65a0b37b524480cb362a3bebb1bc19d"},{"chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin","native_path":"corpus/weishu-weishou/058-yangjin.json","work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin-ws2087998","source_revision":2087998,"raw_path":"sources/weishu-weishou/weishu058-ws2087998.wikitext","raw_file_sha256":"a53ae2dbced88decaa460fbf34f87bb5e65a0b37b524480cb362a3bebb1bc19d"}],"seed_frame":{"chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p014","paragraph_sha256":"b339c5134376f2d4d93dc8504cb8f2bba7c96a633f8170e7e1cab0a5434282fe","source_revision":2087998,"raw_sha256":"a53ae2dbced88decaa460fbf34f87bb5e65a0b37b524480cb362a3bebb1bc19d"},"steps":[{"assertion_id":"a-ws058-jin-jin-brother-chun","from_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAB","to_person_id":"fum_370_iq6_